# Handoff Protocol (L1)

## Locations

- Active: `docs/handoff/active/` (template: `docs/handoff/TEMPLATE.md`)
- Archive: `docs/handoff/archive/`

## Required fields (from template)

Date, Subproject (`brep2code`), Status, Goal, Done, In progress, Next, Decisions, Blockers, Key paths, Resume prompt

## Rules

- Keep `active/` to 1–3 files; archive completed handoffs to `archive/`
- New session: read latest active handoff before coding (skill `handoff-resume`)
- Link ADRs from Handoff Decisions when relevant
- Follow `docs/workflow/task-lifecycle.md`; an active handoff names its related workpack.
- Every active workpack has one Owner. G2/G3 workpacks also name an independent Reviewer.
- After changing workpack, handoff, workflow status, or ADR lifecycle records,
  run `uv run python tools/check_governance.py` before concluding the task.

See `docs/runbooks/handoff-protocol.md`.
